new file mode 100644
index 0000000..dcf50b2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Added a ``beacons.status`` execution module function (and matching
+``Beacon.beacon_status`` internal API) that reports, for each of a
+minion's currently configured beacons, when it last actually fired and
+whether that run raised an error. The status reflects live in-memory
+state on the running minion, updated as beacons fire, so it requires
+no log access, no waiting for the next beacon loop, and no minion
+restart or beacon reconfiguration. A beacon that has not fired yet is
+reported with ``last_fired`` set to ``None``.
